    {
      "blockKey": "evidence",
      "text": "There was no rescue to reward that evening, no oath demanded in exchange. The repaired cup passed between them without ceremony. Later, when the fourth spoke too confidently, the warrior answered him without fear that disagreement would end their place beside the same fire.",
      "mode": "SILENT_HANDWRITING",
      "textSHA256": "76f4f06096b513424a07efd6c3a46319017c2823bbafb923f604c3a244d0d75f"
    },
    {
      "blockKey": "account",
      "text": "That ordinary freedom matters. A follower might have mistaken certainty for strength. Someone who had shared cold meals and foolish plans could recognize the person beneath it. The warrior would challenge him precisely because the friendship allowed more than obedience. The wire was crooked. The cup held.",
